{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_unleashed_actors(npc.UUID) %}
{% set holders = get_nearby_actors(npc.UUID) %}
{{speakingNpc.name}} forcefully|normally|gently leashes a nearby actor's neck|waist with a tight|short|middle|long chain|rope|magic leash. Holder is {{speakingNpc.name}}, another nearby actor, or None to leave the leash hanging from the named body part. Available targets: {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}. Available holders: {{speakingNpc.name}}, {{ holders.actorsNameString }}, or None. Never pick the leashed actor as holder. Never pick anyone not listed except None.
